{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adventure filled with adrenaline rush in your maverick weapon mounted vehicle. Drive in and survive the maps by gathering various collectibles and rack up killing sprees amid the vicious waves of undead chasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825160/extras/2c24f6842c2324371bd56c44c6e816ef.avif?t=1760411753\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides an opportunity to level up your zombie hunting skills and techniques with style only presented in movies and few games. Savor the &quot;in air shooting&quot; experience along with auto &quot;bullet time&quot; mode for clever and creative take down of zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a ride from the list of curated vehicles - pickup truck, sports car, SUV, and lamborghini</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a map based on a theme that interests you and start the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather various collectibles scattered in the map to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the weapons including rocket launcher, minigun, sniper rifle, and flamethrower, lying around and shoot the zombies who try to kill you and obstruct the game progress\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial map is provided to help players familiarize with the controls and basic gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825160?t=1760411753","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825160?t=1760411753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825160/e38e33d35fc2e0b4bff3741efb3f879fa74e5ebf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760411753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825160/e38e33d35fc2e0b4bff3741efb3f879fa74e5ebf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760411753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The mature content in the game consists of heavy use of shooting weapons which generates zombies' blood splattering scenes. The vehicle, that you drive, when used to trample zombies, can produce disturbing images on the screen."},"demos":[{"appid":3911290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adventure filled with adrenaline rush in your maverick weapon mounted vehicle. Drive in and survive the maps by gathering various collectibles and rack up killing sprees amid the vicious waves of undead chasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825160/extras/2c24f6842c2324371bd56c44c6e816ef.avif?t=1760411753\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides an opportunity to level up your zombie hunting skills and techniques with style only presented in movies and few games. Savor the &quot;in air shooting&quot; experience along with auto &quot;bullet time&quot; mode for clever and creative take down of zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a ride from the list of curated vehicles - pickup truck, sports car, SUV, and lamborghini</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a map based on a theme that interests you and start the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather various collectibles scattered in the map to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the weapons including rocket launcher, minigun, sniper rifle, and flamethrower, lying around and shoot the zombies who try to kill you and obstruct the game progress\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial map is provided to help players familiarize with the controls and basic gameplay.</p>","developers":["Central Charge"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825160/d32132211f1cf7977f19a1a68372230a7747194d/header.jpg?t=1760411753","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825160/2018270/086f3ecb65adf34762d86bdf24016d07b1c23355/1755743012/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755748066","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825160/2018270/086f3ecb65adf34762d86bdf24016d07b1c23355/1755743012/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755748066","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825160/2018270/086f3ecb65adf34762d86bdf24016d07b1c23355/1755743012/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755748066","id":257186405,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186405/movie480.mp4?t=1755748066","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186405/movie_max.mp4?t=1755748066"},"name":"EgyptMapTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186405/ab1a00be889177729fc3cba712b53c600cc51161/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755748066","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186405/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755748066","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186405/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755748066"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3825160/1634831238/4d86403fe60eae2a4666a251e65477f7f228e58d/1750510674/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751034392","dash_h264":"ht